<Workshop2025 active="overview">
  <p>The workshop marked 25 years of aerial robotics by reflecting on the field’s advances and looking toward future opportunities and challenges. Its program combined invited talks, interactive discussions, contributed-paper spotlights, a poster session, and a young researchers panel.</p>

  <h2>Topics</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Unmanned Aerial Systems innovations and applications</li>
    <li>Navigation and planning</li>
    <li>Aerial robotic systems physically interacting with the environment</li>
    <li>Perception-based aerial robotics</li>
    <li>Multi-robot systems</li>
  </ul>

  <p>See the <a href="https://2025.ieee-icra.org/event/25-years-of-aerial-robotics-challenges-and-opportunities/">official ICRA 2025 event page</a>, 
  
  or the <a href="/blog/icra2025/">workshop news</a>.</p>
</Workshop2025>
